    "BrochureContent": [
      {
        "ContentType": "Description",
        "SortOrder": 0,
        "Content": "Upcoming Open Viewings: \r\n3 Sept, 13:00 - 13:15\r\n3 Sept, 18:00 - 18:15\r\n\r\nArtis are delighted to present to the market this superb dual aspect two bedroom ground floor apartment. Extending to a spacious 81 sq. m. / 871 sq. ft, 2 Seamount House boasts generous proportions and a wonderful quality of light throughout due to its excellent dual aspect with east and south facing large windows and French doors. There is direct access from the apartment to the communal garden which wraps around the apartment. Situated adjacent to Sandymount Strand and only a short walk from lovely Sandymount Village this fine apartment is sure to appeal to both investors and owner occupiers. \r\nUpon entering the property one is welcomed by a generous entrance hall with excellent storage. There is a gorgeous light filled dual aspect living area boasting a bay window and French doors leading to the communal garden. Off the living area a spacious kitchen/ breakfast room has doors leading to the south facing terrace overlooking the communal garden. There is a main bedroom with ensuite and a further spacious double bedroom. A useful utility room and main bathroom complete the accommodation. Seamount House enjoys one of Dublin’s most convenient and popular locations having all of Sandymount’s many amenities including Sandymount Strand, within walking distance. Sandymount Village and Ballsbridge with their vast array of bijou restaurants, coffee shops and boutiques are all within a gentle stroll. Public transport is well catered for in with easy access available to Sandymount DART station and numerous bus routes. St. Johns Road is also just a short drive from some of Dublin’s principle places of business such as Fitzwilliam Square, Merrion Square, Baggot Street and the IT hub at Grand Canal Dock. Numerous sports grounds are all close by including the RDS, the Aviva Stadium, Merrion and Pembroke Cricket Clubs, Railway Union Sports Club and Lansdowne Football Club. \r\n\r\nBER Details \r\nBER: D2 \r\nBER number: 108576901\r\nEnergy rating: 265.18 (kWh/m2/yr) \r\n\r\nMANAGEMENT DETAILS \r\nManagement Company: \r\nSeamount House Limited \r\n\r\nManagement Agent: \r\nMargaret O’Callaghan \r\nService Charge: €3,000 (2026)"
      },
      {
        "ContentType": "Accommodation",
        "SortOrder": 1,
        "Content": "Hall: \r\nCarpet, intercom, built in storage cupboards, door to shelved hotpress. \r\n\r\nLiving room: \r\n3.70 x 6.91 (max) \r\nCarpet, fireplace, French doors leading to communal gardens, French doors leading to Juliet balcony. \r\n\r\nKitchen/breakfast room: \r\n3.81 x 2.49\r\nTiled floors, dining area, Flavel oven & Beko hob, sink with draining board, plumbed for dishwasher, patio doors leading to balcony. \r\n\r\nBedroom 1: \r\n3.30 x 4.44 \r\nCarpet, patio doors opening to a Juliet balcony, inbuilt wardrobes. \r\n\r\nEn-suite: \r\n1.36 x 2.23 \r\nTiled shower, toilet, basin, chrome heated towel rail, mirror with shelf. \r\n\r\nBedroom 2: \r\n2.72 x 4.39 \r\nCarpet, built in wardrobe, patio doors opening on to Juliet balcony.\r\n\r\nBathroom: \r\n2.48 x 1.66 \r\nTiled, W/C basin, bath with shower, chrome heated towel rail, mirror with shelf, extractor fan. Utility: 1.22 x 2.50 Tiled floor, currently hosting washing machine, tumble dryer and fridge. \r\n\r\nBalcony/terrace: \r\n2.4 x 1.52\r\nTiles, steel balustrade, external light."
      },
      {
        "ContentType": "Features",
        "SortOrder": 3,
        "Content": "•\tSpacious 2-bedroom ground floor apartment.\r\n•\tGenerous accommodation extending to approx. 81 sq. m. / 872 sq. ft.\r\n•\tLarge utility room.\r\n•\tResidents parking.\r\n•\tGas fired central heating.\r\n•\tDirect access to communal garden.\r\n•\tSpacious balcony.\r\n•\tDual aspect apartment (South & West).\r\n•\tPrime Sandymount location set along at the end of the tree lined St. Johns Road at its junction with Strand Road.\r\n•\tWithin walking distance of many amenities including Sandymount Strand and Sandymount Village.\r\n•\tWell serviced by public transport including Bus and Dart lines."
      },
